        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019168-c0447b62a33ebc5d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019168",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since March 2021, we have marketed ARCALYST, our only commercial product, in the United States for recurrent pericarditis and have established our own specialty salesforce to expand our commercialization efforts nationwide.",
        "start_character": 31835,
        "end_character": 32058
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-019168",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-019168-c0447b62a33ebc5d",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019168",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since we currently expect to develop KPL-387 for the treatment of recurrent pericarditis, we believe that it will compete with the same assets as those described under “Business—Competition—ARCALYST”, which includes a number of drugs that target IL-1α and/or IL-1β.",
